<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>1</b></sup> I will praise thee with my whole heart: before the gods will I sing praise unto thee.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>2</b></sup> I will worship toward thy holy temple, and praise thy name for thy lovingkindness and for thy truth: for thou hast magnified thy word above all thy name.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>3</b></sup> In the day when I cried thou answeredst me, <i>and</i> strengthenedst me <i>with</i> strength in my soul.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>4</b></sup> All the kings of the earth shall praise thee, O LORD, when they hear the words of thy mouth.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>5</b></sup> Yea, they shall sing in the ways of the LORD: for great <i>is</i> the glory of the LORD.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>6</b></sup> Though the LORD <i>be</i> high, yet hath he respect unto the lowly: but the proud he knoweth afar off.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>7</b></sup> Though I walk in the midst of trouble, thou wilt revive me: thou shalt stretch forth thine hand against the wrath of mine enemies, and thy right hand shall save me.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>8</b></sup> The LORD will perfect <i>that which</i> concerneth me: thy mercy, O LORD, <i>endureth</i> for ever: forsake not the works of thine own hands. <br />
